# SAP RBSC repository - source of @sap/xotel-agent-ext-js (SAP Cloud ALM OpenTelemetry agent).
# SAP_NPM_AUTH = "NPM Base64 Credentials" of the RBSC technical user. Set it as a secret in the build pipeline.
